Dialogue: 0,00:00:00.000,00:00:01.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah
Dialogue: 0,00:00:01.200,00:00:02.200,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a singer
Dialogue: 0,00:00:02.400,00:00:03.400,Default,,0,0,0,,You were my fan
Dialogue: 0,00:00:03.600,00:00:04.600,Default,,0,0,0,,When no one gave a damn
Dialogue: 0,00:00:04.800,00:00:05.800,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you in the dark
Dialogue: 0,00:00:06.000,00:00:07.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared of your anger
Dialogue: 0,00:00:07.200,00:00:08.200,Default,,0,0,0,,In love with your whim
Dialogue: 0,00:00:08.400,00:00:09.400,Default,,0,0,0,,Some notes I don't hit
Dialogue: 0,00:00:09.600,00:00:10.600,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't give up
Dialogue: 0,00:00:10.800,00:00:11.800,Default,,0,0,0,,Now every day, the plane takes off
Dialogue: 0,00:00:12.000,00:00:13.000,Default,,0,0,0,,And every night, the room fills up with
Dialogue: 0,00:00:13.200,00:00:14.200,Default,,0,0,0,,People who are convinced I'm not
Dialogue: 0,00:00:14.400,00:00:15.400,Default,,0,0,0,,Just some kid fakin' it for your love
Dialogue: 0,00:00:15.600,00:00:16.600,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm an actress, all of the medals I won for ya
Dialogue: 0,00:00:16.800,00:00:17.800,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking my back just to be your favourite daughter
Dialogue: 0,00:00:18.000,00:00:19.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere I run, I'm always runnin' to ya
Dialogue: 0,00:00:19.200,00:00:20.200,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking my back just hoping you'll say I'm a star
Dialogue: 0,00:00:20.400,00:00:21.400,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a brother, I look like him
Dialogue: 0,00:00:21.600,00:00:22.600,Default,,0,0,0,,You told us as kids
Dialogue: 0,00:00:22.800,00:00:23.800,Default,,0,0,0,,"He diеd of a broken heart"
Dialogue: 0,00:00:24.000,00:00:25.000,Default,,0,0,0,,And for evеry door you open
Dialogue: 0,00:00:25.200,00:00:26.200,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a room I can't go in
Dialogue: 0,00:00:26.400,00:00:27.400,Default,,0,0,0,,I break in, I still can't find you
Dialogue: 0,00:00:27.600,00:00:28.600,Default,,0,0,0,,See Lorde Live
Dialogue: 0,00:00:28.800,00:00:29.800,Default,,0,0,0,,Get tickets as low as $42
Dialogue: 0,00:00:30.000,00:00:31.000,Default,,0,0,0,,You might also like
Dialogue: 0,00:00:31.200,00:00:32.200,Default,,0,0,0,,Current Affairs
Dialogue: 0,00:00:32.400,00:00:33.400,Default,,0,0,0,,Lorde
Dialogue: 0,00:00:33.600,00:00:34.600,Default,,0,0,0,,Shapeshifter
Dialogue: 0,00:00:34.800,00:00:35.800,Default,,0,0,0,,Lorde
Dialogue: 0,00:00:36.000,00:00:37.000,Default,,0,0,0,,David
Dialogue: 0,00:00:37.200,00:00:38.200,Default,,0,0,0,,Lorde
Dialogue: 0,00:00:38.400,00:00:39.400,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that every day, the plane takes off
Dialogue: 0,00:00:39.600,00:00:40.600,Default,,0,0,0,,And every night the room fills up
Dialogue: 0,00:00:40.800,00:00:41.800,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell myself that soon we'll talk
Dialogue: 0,00:00:42.000,00:00:43.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I sing every word just to ya
Dialogue: 0,00:00:43.200,00:00:44.200,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm an actress, all of the medals I won for ya
Dialogue: 0,00:00:44.400,00:00:45.400,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic attack just to be your favourite daughter
Dialogue: 0,00:00:45.600,00:00:46.600,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere I run, I'm always runnin' to ya
Dialogue: 0,00:00:46.800,00:00:47.800,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking my back to carry the weight of your heart
Dialogue: 0,00:00:48.000,00:00:49.000,Default,,0,0,0,,But I keep dancing till I get sick
Dialogue: 0,00:00:49.200,00:00:50.200,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to dream so big?
Dialogue: 0,00:00:50.400,00:00:51.400,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did no one listen when you hit the notes from your heart?
Dialogue: 0,00:00:51.600,00:00:52.600,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah, ah
Dialogue: 0,00:00:52.800,00:00:53.800,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a good actress, look at the medals I won for ya
Dialogue: 0,00:00:54.000,00:00:55.000,Default,,0,0,0,,So you could imagine being a favourite daughter
Dialogue: 0,00:00:55.200,00:00:56.200,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere I run, I'm always runnin' to ya
Dialogue: 0,00:00:56.400,00:00:57.400,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking my back just to be as brave as my mother
